ons asleep in their weird way.</div> </div> </div> </div>Aren't the Baali even more reinforcement of the Caine myth?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-01-24T14:34:58-08:00","id":1529345,"title":"","content":"I'm gonna throw in that in my headcanon the Baali either never existed or they stopped to exist sometime in the early Bronze Age.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/970-gurkhal","name":"Gurkhal","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"863"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-01-24T15:37:25-08:00","id":1529357,"title":"","content":"how's this one? i hear it's pretty good <a href=\"https://preview.drivethrurpg.com/pt/product/336923/Vampire-Twentieth-Anniversary-Edition-The-Classical-Age?\" target=\"_blank\">https://preview.drivethrurpg.com/pt/...Classical-Age?</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-01-24T23:05:13-08:00","id":1529403,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nicolas Milioni</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1529233-the-roman-kindred-during-julius-caesar-life?p=1529357#post1529357\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">how's this one? i hear it's pretty good <a href=\"https://preview.drivethrurpg.com/pt/product/336923/Vampire-Twentieth-Anniversary-Edition-The-Classical-Age?\" target=\"_blank\">https://preview.drivethrurpg.com/pt/...Classical-Age?</a></div> </div> </div> </div>As a Storyteller's Vault author I do not generally comment on the works of other authors, but it is worth noting that this is a work by a primarily non-English speaking author, and appears to have been translated into English via Google Translate. Thus, you get details like &quot;the embrace&quot; being rendered as &quot;the hug&quot; (with, in one place, Nosferatu &quot;making mass hugs to meet all their needs&quot;, or the &quot;Curmudgeon&quot; Archetype being the &quot;Grumpy&quot; Archetype. There is the occasional paragraph which remains in Portuguese, and some rather odd formatting in places. How much you this will get in the way of your consumption of the book will depend on your tolerance level of such matters.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/317-james_willoughby","name":"James_Willoughby","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar317_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"297"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-01-25T02:16:18-08:00","id":1529409,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nicolas Milioni</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1529233-the-roman-kindred-during-julius-caesar-life?p=1529357#post1529357\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">how's this one? i hear it's pretty good <a href=\"https://preview.drivethrurpg.com/pt/product/336923/Vampire-Twentieth-Anniversary-Edition-The-Classical-Age?\" target=\"_blank\">https://preview.drivethrurpg.com/pt/...Classical-Age?</a></div> </div> </div> </div>I can only echo what James Willoughby said. I really tried to like the material because it is clearly a passion project but I, a non-native-english-speaker aswell, hat great trouble with, not because of a lack of vocabulary on my own, but because the translation and structure was...I guess &quot;akward&quot;. Subsequent publications by the author where a little bit easier to read imho but it is still difficult.<br /> <br /> Personally I like this one the most...<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/393382/Rome-By-Night-Via-Desideratio?src=hottest_filtered&amp;filters=0_0_45670_0_0_0_0_0\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/images/1/393382.png\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/393382/Rome-By-Night-Via-Desideratio?src=hottest_filtered&amp;filters=0_0_45670_0_0_0_0_0\" target=\"_blank\"> Rome By Night Via Desideratio - White Wolf | Storytellers Vault </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/393382/Rome-By-Night-Via-Desideratio?src=hottest_filtered&amp;filters=0_0_45670_0_0_0_0_0\" target=\"_blank\"> https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/393382/Rome-By-Night-Via-Desideratio?src=hottest_filtered&amp;filters=0_0_45670_0_0_0_0_0 </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> Rome By Night Via Desideratio - 275 BC, the King of Epirus has been beaten and Rome has emerged as the main ruler of the South Italian peninsula, raisin </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> It is foremost a campagne but it has a very nice appendix with setting information on rome in the context of kindred history. It focuses mainly on the punic wars but it has a nice timeline and tips for playing in later eras.<br /> <br /> I got great use out of it for my own roman campagne.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25379-spacedigger","name":"Spacedigger","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"53"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-01-25T12:07:56-08:00","id":1529450,"title":"","content":"I like the notion that the Baali are not a bloodline or clan but a weird sect of Kindred of the carious clans who learned of some very dangerous things that they barely understand or control in the remote past and the more sane members have decided to put them out their misery.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}